```
Requirement | Design    | Task    | Test    | Acceptance | Status
REQ-001     | DESIGN-04 | TASK-12 | TEST-44 | AC-01      | PASS
REQ-002     | DESIGN-06 | TASK-13 | TEST-51 | AC-02      | PASS
REQ-003     | DESIGN-08 | —       | —       | —          | MISSING
```

任意一环是 `—` 就标 `MISSING`，不是漏掉不写。`AUDIT_PROJECT` /
`FINALIZE_PROJECT` 必须扫出所有 `MISSING` 行。
